Prebuilt llama.cpp and whisper.cpp server binaries for interview-ai Local AI mode.

This repository holds no source code. It exists so the application does not
depend on a third-party repository for its runtime binaries. The files are
published as release assets, not committed here.

Each binary is pinned by SHA-256 in interview-ai's src/utils/native-ai-runtime.js
and verified after download. A checksum mismatch is rejected rather than executed,
so replacing an asset here cannot cause a client to run unexpected code.

checksums.txt in this repository is the authoritative manifest for the
local-ai-binaries-v1 release.

llama.cpp   - MIT, https://github.com/ggml-org/llama.cpp
whisper.cpp - MIT, https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp
